# Direct checkout (replaces the Shopify storefront). This site has no backend of
# its own: /order calls the Test Your World backend, which holds every price and
# the Stripe key. Set this to that backend's public URL with NO trailing slash,
# e.g. https://your-backend.up.railway.app
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables are inlined at build time, so set it in the Vercel
# project settings (Production AND Preview) before deploying. It is not a secret.
#
# The backend must also have SITE_URL set to this site's public address
# (https://www.testyourworld.com) so Stripe sends customers back here and
# the backend's CORS accepts requests from it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
